  "prefLabel": "Box 703.09 Officials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 703.09 Officials. At least one month prior to a competition, a promoter shall provide the commission with a preliminary list of officials scheduled to attend a competition, including referees, judges, timekeepers, scorekeepers, and medical professionals. The promoter shall provide the commission with a brief resume of each official’s experience.\n\nSource. #10483, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14066 eff 8-27-24",
